原本用于在特定配置下对 `gradOutput` 张量进行数据类型转换。修改后，偏置梯度的计算将直接基于原始的或经过其他预处理的 `gradOutput` 张量进行，从而简化计算图，减少不必要的内存操作和计算开销。","created_at":"2026-04-09T19:28:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-09T19:28:26+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167973681,"discussion_id":"055a64d772a7b1196dbd5e32b5afd13e8191f11b","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-10T18:00:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-10T18:00:41+08:00","user":{"id":"68d20f973ea9c30418175a13","login":"Jiaxin_001","object_id":"68d20f973ea9c30418175a13","name":"Jiaxin_001","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Jiaxin_001"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167973917,"discussion_id":"255b469d5afc3893ef1fc9c62324705eff306fe3","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=c43a8e3e79984c18b4076cedc1ebab4a&projectName=CANN'>c43a8e3e79984c18b4076cedc1ebab4a</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_ubuntu24</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=c43a8e3e79984c18b4076cedc1ebab4a&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_mobile_station</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n            